{"hw":"ἐπιορκέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπιορκέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιορκ-έω</span>, also <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐφιορκέω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.1126.9</span> </span> (Delph. Amphict.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">229.69</span> </span> (Smyrna, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), etc.: <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ήσω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.188</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lys.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">914</span> </span>, etc., <span class=\"gk\">-ήσομαι </span>(<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">κατ-</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">54.40</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιώρκησα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">49.67</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ορκῆσαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.68</span> </span> ( v.l. ἐφ- ): <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιώρκηκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">948e</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.1.22</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Din.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.47</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">ἐπιόρκηκα</span> is <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> Hdt.l.c.):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">swear falsely, forswear oneself</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐδ'</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιορκήσω πρὸς δαίμονος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.188</span> </span>: also, c.acc., of things sworn by, <span class=\"gk\">τὰς βασιληΐας ἱστίας ἐπιώρκηκε</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">has sworn falsely by</b> the royal hearth, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.68</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θεάς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Din.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.47</span> </span>; [<span class=\"gk\">θεούς</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Av.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1609</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4.7</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">49.67</span> </span>, etc.: mostly abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">298</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">428</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">402</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">65c</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οὐδὲν ἐφρόντιζ' ἐπιορκῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.119</span> </span>: c.acc.cogn., <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. ὅρκους τινί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">49.65</span> </span>, cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.115</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">εὐορκέω</span>, Lexap.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.98</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cleanth.Stoic.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.131</span> </span>, Chrysipp.ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.63</span> </span>, who distinguishes betw. <span class=\"gk\">εὐορκεῖν</span> and <span class=\"gk\">ἀληθορκεῖν</span>, and betw. <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιορκεῖν</span> and <span class=\"gk\">ψευδορκεῖν</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span>. simply, = ὄμνυμι, <b class=\"lex-tr\">swear</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sol.</span> </span> ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.17</span> </span>.</div></div>"}